---
// APIM subscription (developer key) state machine — gateway-centric model, lifecycle per
// plans/21-provision-deprovision.md (#65/#66): a key IS an APIM subscription created under
// a tier product. Rotation (regeneratePrimaryKey + regenerateSecondaryKey — both keys) and quota changes (re-scope to another
// tier product) keep it Active; 403/429 are gateway responses and change nothing. Admin
// deactivation, Entra departure and admin key revocation all DELETE the subscription;
// re-activation re-runs provisioning (reusing an orphan subscription if one exists).
// There is no suspend state. Colours come from .fgd-s-* in diagrams.css.
---

<figure class="fgd fgd-kl not-content" role="group" aria-labelledby="fgd-kl-title" aria-describedby="fgd-kl-desc">
  <p id="fgd-kl-title" class="fgd-sr-only">APIM key lifecycle state machine</p>
  <p id="fgd-kl-desc" class="fgd-sr-only">
    From No key, first login or admin provision creates an APIM subscription under the developer's tier product and
    the key becomes Active. While Active: rotating the key regenerates both the primary and the secondary key and stays Active; changing the
    quota re-scopes the subscription to the new tier's product and stays Active (the gateway's monthly counter
    restarts for that subscription; live validation tracked in #88); a 403 for an exhausted monthly quota or a 429
    with Retry-After for the per-minute cap are gateway responses that change nothing. Admin deactivation, Entra
    departure, or admin key revocation delete the subscription: Deleted. Re-activation runs a fresh provision,
    reusing an orphan subscription if one exists, and returns to Active. There is no suspended state.
  </p>
  <div class="fgd-svg-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Key lifecycle diagram — scrolls sideways on narrow screens">
    <svg
      class="fgd-svg"
      viewBox="0 0 700 372"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      style="min-width:660px;max-width:740px;margin:0 auto;"
      aria-hidden="true"
      focusable="false"
    >
      <title>APIM key lifecycle</title>
      <defs>
        <marker id="fgd-kl-head" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z" class="fgd-s-head" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="fgd-kl-head-green" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z" class="fgd-s-head fgd-s-head--green" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="fgd-kl-head-azure" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z" class="fgd-s-head fgd-s-head--azure" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- No key yet -->
      <rect x="260" y="14" width="130" height="46" rx="8" class="fgd-s-box fgd-s-box--ext" />
      <text x="325" y="33" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-title">No key yet</text>
      <text x="325" y="49" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-sub">initial state</text>

      <!-- Gateway responses callout (no state change) -->
      <rect x="470" y="10" width="222" height="84" rx="8" class="fgd-s-box fgd-s-box--callout" />
      <text x="581" y="30" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-title fgd-s-title--callout">Gateway responses — no state change</text>
      <text x="581" y="47" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-label--ember">403 · monthly quota exhausted</text>
      <text x="581" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-label--ember">429 + Retry-After · per-minute cap</text>
      <text x="581" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label">key keeps working when the window resets</text>
      <path d="M 472,92 L 432,130" class="fgd-s-edge fgd-s-edge--ember" />

      <!-- No key → Active (labels on the left, clear of the callout) -->
      <line x1="325" y1="60" x2="325" y2="128" class="fgd-s-edge fgd-s-edge--azure" marker-end="url(#fgd-kl-head-azure)" />
      <text x="317" y="82" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label">first login / admin provision</text>
      <text x="317" y="96" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-mono">POST /subscriptions</text>
      <text x="317" y="109" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-mono">scope: tier product</text>

      <!-- Active -->
      <rect x="220" y="130" width="210" height="60" rx="8" class="fgd-s-box fgd-s-box--active" />
      <text x="325" y="152" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-title fgd-s-title--active">Active</text>
      <text x="325" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-sub">APIM subscription · state = active</text>
      <text x="325" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-sub fgd-s-mono">under Standard / Power / Unlimited</text>

      <!-- Active ⟲ rotate (right loop) -->
      <path d="M 430,148 C 482,140 482,182 430,176" class="fgd-s-edge fgd-s-edge--green" marker-end="url(#fgd-kl-head-green)" />
      <text x="488" y="156" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-label--green">rotate key</text>
      <text x="488" y="170" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-mono">regenerate both keys</text>

      <!-- Active ⟲ change quota (left loop) -->
      <path d="M 220,148 C 168,140 168,182 220,176" class="fgd-s-edge fgd-s-edge--green" marker-end="url(#fgd-kl-head-green)" />
      <text x="162" y="143" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-label--green">change quota =</text>
      <text x="162" y="156" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label">re-scope subscription</text>
      <text x="162" y="169" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label">to the new tier product</text>
      <text x="162" y="182" text-anchor="end" class="fgd-s-label">(monthly counter restarts)</text>

      <!-- Active → Deleted -->
      <line x1="385" y1="190" x2="525" y2="270" class="fgd-s-edge" marker-end="url(#fgd-kl-head)" />
      <text x="478" y="212" class="fgd-s-label">deactivation · Entra departure ·</text>
      <text x="478" y="225" class="fgd-s-label">admin key revocation</text>
      <text x="478" y="238" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-mono">DELETE /subscriptions/&#123;sid&#125;</text>

      <!-- Deleted -->
      <rect x="470" y="272" width="200" height="56" rx="8" class="fgd-s-box fgd-s-box--deleted" />
      <text x="570" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-title fgd-s-title--deleted">Deleted</text>
      <text x="570" y="311" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-sub">subscription removed · key dead</text>

      <!-- Deleted → Active (re-activation = fresh provision) -->
      <path d="M 470,302 C 360,302 250,296 250,194" class="fgd-s-edge fgd-s-edge--green" marker-end="url(#fgd-kl-head-green)" />
      <text x="330" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label fgd-s-label--green">re-activation = fresh provision</text>
      <text x="330" y="335" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label">reuses an orphan subscription if one exists</text>

      <!-- Footnote -->
      <text x="350" y="364" text-anchor="middle" class="fgd-s-label">Only people-lifecycle events change state — rotation, tier re-scoping, 403s and 429s never do.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>
<p class="fgd-svg-hint">Scroll the diagram sideways to see the whole state machine.</p>
